{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"tools":[{"name":"execute_blender_code","description":"Execute ordinary read-only bpy/Python in this session persistent private Blender namespace. NumPy, mathutils BVH, mesh/triangle reading, your own Python computations and cached variables are allowed. Only this scene and your own computations may be read; no fixture sources, management files or scoring data. No scene edits or saving. Image delivery disabled.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"code":{"type":"string"}},"required":["code"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"human_eye_spatial_relations","description":"Read current solid relations and surface distances from a target to 1..3 explicit candidates in one capture. Returns each pair, penetrating candidates and nearest separated ties; unknowns and incomplete sets stay explicit. Surface distance is not penetration depth. Read-only: no images or actions.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256}},"oneOf":[{"required":["id"]},{"required":["name"]}],"additionalProperties":false},"candidates":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256}},"oneOf":[{"required":["id"]},{"required":["name"]}],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":1,"maxItems":3},"include_aabb":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},"required":["target","candidates"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"human_eye_surface_nearest","description":"Find the nearest triangle surfaces, in metres, from one current Blender mesh to all other meshes in the scene. Complete results give global nearest ties; partial results give best-known candidates and unresolved coverage. Surface distance is unsigned, not penetration depth. Read-only: no images or actions. Example: {\"target\":{\"name\":\"Bracket\"}}.","annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false},"inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256}},"oneOf":[{"required":["id"]},{"required":["name"]}],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["target"],"additionalProperties":false}}]}}
